   | EXIT (from exitResult) 
   | REJECT errorValue (from rejectTransitionResult) 

relation Callee_eval: cursor evalContext arch |- callableTargetIR `< '_' `> `( argumentListIR `) : evalContext arch calleeResult

  rulegroup actionCallee

    rule actionCallee: p EC ARCH |- referenceExpressionIR as callableTargetIR `< '_' `> `( argumentListIR `) : EC ARCH _CONT actionCallee as callee as calleeResult
